title: sync:plan
tags: [[GUI command]] Sync
kind: reference
summary: Sync: compute the plan (from the intents file given, else the toolbar's)

See [[sync panel]] and [[The sync plan]]. Conflicts are not asked: they are left
skipped, to decide in the panel ([[Sync conflicts]]).

`sync:plan <path>` takes the intents file as an argument, and fills the toolbar's
field with it; without one, the field's is used, and an empty field is refused.
